{"t":"Corrupted Mines","s":"corrupted-mines-09596","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Corrupted_Ghost_a12168.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Corrupted Mines</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Corrupted Ghost\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corrupted_Ghost_a12168.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northeastern area of Newhaven, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32596,32458,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32596, 32458, 7)</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe Corrupted Mines are an abandoned coal mine in the northeastern region of <a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a>. Once a source of prosperity for the island, the site was abandoned after all the ore had been extracted. Legend has it that a tragic accident buried a group of miners alive. Since then, their souls have haunted the tunnels.<br/>\nIt is a hunting ground for novice adventurers who have learned the basics of combat against the Muglex goblin clan and now seek greater challenges and stronger foes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Corrupted%20Ghost\"><img alt=\"Corrupted Ghost\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Corrupted_Ghost_a12168.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Corrupted%20Ghost\">Corrupted Ghost</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">29</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-16× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cape (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-5× Lightest Missile Rune (very rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× Light Stone Shower Rune (very rare)</li>\n<li>Ranger's Cloak (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Plain Monk Robe (very rare)</li>\n<li>Magician's Robe (very rare)</li>\n<li>Soldier Helmet (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\">